 in Ajuda, Lisbon","Tastefully furnished 2-bedroom and recently renovated apartment for rent in Ajuda. The property is fully equipped and has top-notch materials. It includes an air-conditioned in every room, a king-size luxury bed, a giant smart-TV, a laundry room with a washing machine and a drier, a pantry, a wine cellar, two full bathrooms, a 6 meters long closet area, and a garage parking space with direct indoor access. There is a dishwasher, a farmhouse sink, an oven, a coffee machine, two large refrigerators, extensive tableware and every kitchen gadget you can imagine. The apartment has built-in storage in every room and it is a three-bedroom conversion, so one of the rooms is quite large. You can enjoy the incredible panoramic river views from one of the three balconies. This is a smart home, with electronically and remotely controlled lighting and shades, with smoke, water, and motion detectors. It is located in a residential neighborhood, minutes away from the Tagus river and it is served by excellent road access to the city center, Cascais and Sintra.\n\nPerfect for a person, a couple, or a small family who wants to live - in a newly renovated apartment - with the best river views","/lisbon/for-rent:apartments/641445",{"_818":284,"_1080":284,"_819":284,"_820":284,"_1287":284,"_1288":284,"_863":284,"_822":284,"_823":284,"_1083":284,"_824":284,"_770":284,"_825":284,"_1289":284,"_900":284,"_865":284,"_1084":284,"_1085":284,"_1086":284,"_1087":284,"_827":284,"_1088":284,"_1426":284,"_1089":284,"_866":284,"_867":284,"_868":284,"_869":284,"_870":284,"_772":284},[],{"_757":2229,"_759":2230,"_9":761,"_369":2231},"3f2d5a81-cbe1-4bbe-8a75-b1f61e6386a7",[2196,2197,2198,2199,2200,2201,2202,2203,2204,2205,2206,2207,2208,2209,2210,2211,2212,2213,2214,2215,2216,2217,2218,2219,2220,2221,2222,2223,2224,2225,2226,2227,2228],[],"3200",["N",{"_729":2194,"_730":2195,"_211":731}],350,46,"755d384e319e4fb215d2c4af9febdc9e67ee0160ac1b0b66a4bdd121","15cb2c75af0bed3cae48577537c61